<h1>{{title}}</h1>
<p>
  An illustrative starter for <code>@nestvexa/forms</code>: registration and
  sign-in with a host-owned policy, and a profile editor that works as a Live
  component and as a plain HTML form when JavaScript is unavailable.
</p>
<p>
  <strong>Not a production identity provider.</strong> Accounts live in process
  memory and there is no email verification, password reset or multi-factor
  authentication.
</p>
